{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 \u672b\u65e5\u4e4b\u706b(DoomsdayFire) is a comprehensive game that deeply integrates strategic planning and fine resource management elements. Players will take on the role of a penniless survivor in a virtual world full of challenges and opportunities. In this world, players need to use strategic thinking to rationally allocate various resources, collect materials to continuously add wood to the campfire, build various buildings, recruit more villagers, and flexibly allocate classes to obtain more materials to cope with the apocalyptic winter set in the game. The player's core goal is to survive the cold apocalypse, build more wooden houses, and then expand their home, make reasonable choices about various events, and gradually improve their strength and status in the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690530?t=1748332135","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690530?t=1748332135","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690530/098c165e7d24d2b0f513670d4c7218648724ac59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748332135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690530/098c165e7d24d2b0f513670d4c7218648724ac59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748332135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7 \u672b\u65e5\u4e4b\u706b(DoomsdayFire) is a comprehensive game that deeply integrates strategic planning and fine resource management elements. Players will take on the role of a penniless survivor in a virtual world full of challenges and opportunities. In this world, players need to use strategic thinking to rationally allocate various resources, collect materials to continuously add wood to the campfire,